# OpenWeatherMap API key — OPTIONAL. The primary precipitation overlay is
# RainViewer's keyless radar API; this key only powers the OpenWeatherMap
# fallback tiles used if the RainViewer frame index can't be fetched.
# Get a free key at https://home.openweathermap.org/api_keys
OWM_API_KEY=your_openweathermap_api_key_here
